@startuml
title Módulo CRM / Clientes

actor Usuario
participant "Router" as R
participant "ClientesController" as CC
participant "ClienteRepository" as CR
participant "Database" as DB
participant "View" as V

== CRUD Clientes ==
Usuario -> R: GET /clientes
R -> CC: index()
CC -> CR: allWithVendedor()
CR -> DB: SELECT con LEFT JOIN
DB --> CR: clientes array
CC -> V: view('clientes/index')

Usuario -> R: GET /clientes/create
R -> CC: create()
CC -> V: view('clientes/create')

Usuario -> R: POST /clientes/store
R -> CC: store()
CC -> CR: create(data)
CC -> R: redirect /clientes

Usuario -> R: GET /clientes/show/{id}
R -> CC: show(id)
CC -> CR: findWithVendedor(id)
CC -> DB: ventas del cliente
CC -> V: view('clientes/show')

== Mis Clientes (Vendedor) ==
Usuario -> R: GET /mis-clientes
R -> Dashboard\HomeController: misCompras()

note right of CR
  BUG: search() usa columna
  'email' que NO existe en
  la tabla clientes.
  La columna correcta es 'correo'.
end note

@enduml
